{
    "title": "Solitaire: Card Games",
    "description": "Get ready to immerse yourself in the world of Solitaire: Card Games, a classic Solitaire card game that lets you build and design your own resort. With beautiful decorations and customized renovations, you can create a unique resort that reflects your personal style and preferences.\r\n\r\nAt its core, Solitaire: Card Games is a creative card game with an exciting storyline based on classic solitaire gameplay. As you progress through challenging levels, you'll interact with characters and explore different parts of the resort, all while training your brain and having fun.\r\n\r\nBut what sets Solitaire: Card Games apart from other solitaire games is its resort theme. We've designed a wonderful resort setting that includes coffee shops, kitchens, and more, giving you the opportunity to collect various beautiful decorations during the card games and truly make your resort your own.\r\n\r\nAnd with left-handed support and multiple languages available, Solitaire: Card Games is accessible to players from all over the world. Whether you're a beginner or a pro, you can choose between 1-card or 3-card modes to customize your gaming experience and improve your skills.\r\n\r\nSo why wait? Download Solitaire: Card Games now and start playing this addictive and engaging card game today!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get ready to immerse yourself in the world of Solitaire: Card Games, a classic Solitaire card game that lets you build and design your own resort. With beautiful decorations and customized renovations, you can create a unique resort that reflects your personal style and preferences.<br><br>At its core, Solitaire: Card Games is a creative card game with an exciting storyline based on classic solitaire gameplay. As you progress through challenging levels, you&#39;ll interact with characters and explore different parts of the resort, all while training your brain and having fun.<br><br>But what sets Solitaire: Card Games apart from other solitaire games is its resort theme. We&#39;ve designed a wonderful resort setting that includes coffee shops, kitchens, and more, giving you the opportunity to collect various beautiful decorations during the card games and truly make your resort your own.<br><br>And with left-handed support and multiple languages available, Solitaire: Card Games is accessible to players from all over the world. Whether you&#39;re a beginner or a pro, you can choose between 1-card or 3-card modes to customize your gaming experience and improve your skills.<br><br>So why wait? Download Solitaire: Card Games now and start playing this addictive and engaging card game today!",
